MODULE: ApplicationAcknowledgedWithoutApplying
TARGET: NoSkipWithoutDeadLetter
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: report acceptance without applying or parking the head
PERTURBS: Apply

--- FIND
    /\ applied' = applied \cup {Head(queue)} /\ accepted' = TRUE /\ phase' = "feedback"
--- REPLACE
    /\ applied' = applied /\ accepted' = TRUE /\ phase' = "feedback"
--- END
